# Postgres / Supabase

## Types

| Use | Type |
| --- | --- |
| IDs | `bigint` or `uuid` (match existing tables) |
| Strings | `text` |
| Timestamps | `timestamptz` |
| Money | `numeric` |
| Flags | `boolean` |

## Migrations

- Files under `supabase/migrations/` — never alter production manually
- New columns: nullable or with default — not `NOT NULL` without default on existing tables
- Schema migrations separate from data backfills (seed files in `supabase/seed*.sql`)
- Match naming and RLS patterns from neighbouring migrations (e.g. nutrition, alimentos)

## RLS

```sql
CREATE POLICY policy_name ON table_name
  FOR ALL
  USING ((SELECT auth.uid()) = user_id);
```

- Enable RLS on every user-data table
- Test policies against coach vs client roles defined in ADRs

## Indexes

- Index foreign keys and common filter columns
- Composite indexes: equality columns first, then range

